<title>USA: ProNet wins Columbia/HCA contract.</title>
<headline>ProNet wins Columbia/HCA contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProNet Inc said Thursday it has won a three-year contract to provide paging services for Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>ProNet said the contract begins immediately, with services covering Colubia/HCA's more than 340 facilities and 285,000 employees nationwide.</p>
</text>
